WEBVTT

00:00:00.448 --> 00:00:01.568
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Languages</b>

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:03.160
1

00:00:04.094 --> 00:00:06.370
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you think you’re good at learning languages?

