<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.786 --> 00:00:13.259
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Is there anything about learning English that you’re bad at?

00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:16.018
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:20.050
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you think listening to pop music is good for your English?

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:22.794
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:27.006
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Are you afraid of going to places where you don’t speak the language?

