<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:30.845 --> 00:00:33.888
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What English-speaking countries are you most interested in?

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:36.957
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tourism</b>

00:00:37.812 --> 00:00:38.752
6

