<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:01.707 --> 00:01:05.239
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you get angry with tourists who don’t try to speak your language?

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:07.938
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:08.851 --> 00:01:14.626
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Are people in your capital city very different from people in the rest of your country?